<</Length 239>>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 730 Td 15 TL
(CONTRACTOR SAFETY MANUAL - SECTION 24 - ENVIRONMENTAL CONTROLS) Tj T*
(Spill kits are kept at every chemical store and refuelling point.) Tj T*
(Stormwater drains are covered during concrete washout.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
52 0 obj
<</Type/Page/Parent 2 0 R/MediaBox[0 0 612 792]/Resources<</Font<</F1 3 0 R>>>>/Contents 53 0 R>>
endobj
53 0 obj
<</Length 252>>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 730 Td 15 TL
(CONTRACTOR SAFETY MANUAL - SECTION 25 - SUBCONTRACTORS) Tj T*
(A contractor may engage a subcontractor only with written approval from the site supervisor.) Tj T*
(Subcontractors complete the same site induction.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
54 0 obj
<</Type/Page/Parent 2 0 R/MediaBox[0 0 612 792]/Resources<</Font<</F1 3 0 R>>>>/Contents 55 0 R>>
endobj
55 0 obj
<</Length 245>>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 730 Td 15 TL
(CONTRACTOR SAFETY MANUAL - SECTION 26 - INSURANCE) Tj T*
(Contractors hold public liability cover of at least 20 million dollars.) Tj T*
(Certificates of currency are provided before the first day on site.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
56 0 obj
<</Type/Page/Parent 2 0 R/MediaBox[0 0 612 792]/Resources<</Font<</F1 3 0 R>>>>/Contents 57 0 R>>
endobj
57 0 obj
<</Length 229>>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 730 Td 15 TL
(CONTRACTOR SAFETY MANUAL - SECTION 27 - AUDITS) Tj T*
(The Site Safety Office audits each contractor at least once a quarter.) Tj T*
(Audit findings rated high must be closed within 7 days.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
58 0 obj
<</Type/Page/Parent 2 0 R/MediaBox[0 0 612 792]/Resources<</Font<</F1 3 0 R>>>>/Contents 59 0 R>>
endobj
59 0 obj
<</Length 297>>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 730 Td 15 TL
(CONTRACTOR SAFETY MANUAL - SECTION 28 - NON-COMPLIANCE) Tj T*
(A first breach of this manual results in a written warning.) Tj T*
(A second breach within twelve months removes the contractor from site for 14 days.) Tj T*
(A serious breach ends the contract.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
60 0 obj
<</Type/Page/Parent 2 0 R/MediaBox[0 0 612 792]/Resources<</Font<</F1 3 0 R>>>>/Contents 61 0 R>>
endobj
61 0 obj
<</Length 249>>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 730 Td 15 TL
(CONTRACTOR SAFETY MANUAL - SECTION 29 - CLOSING OUT WORK) Tj T*
(When work is finished, permits are returned and signed closed.) Tj T*
(The leading hand walks the area with the site supervisor before handover.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
